evidence.quote:
- the model is valid;
- the inputs are measured;
- the decision is correct;
- the confidence interval contains the production value;
- more replications will fix a biased model.

A useful insufficient-evidence record is actionable. It names:

- the measurement;
- the range that would support or reject the decision;
- the owner of the measurement;
- the consequence of staying in the current state;
- the next review trigger.

- an arrival trace from the target environment;
- a service-time sample, including the tail;
- a measured timeout and retry policy;
- a measured deployment capacity and cost.
